  "about": "Provenance of damit_runner/core/metalflood/ (Boann, the GPU flood engine). Each file is a byte-for-byte copy of DamSafety_Runner/core/metalflood/ at source_commit (DWR_Plugins main, 2026-11-23: DamSafety Runner 3.74.0 / Boann 5.0.0), the whole folder: the ACC engine and the sub-grid-channel engine (engine_sgc) that the DamIT Runner offers, the shock-capturing engines (FV, FV2, DG2) and the sub-grid finite-volume engine (engine_subfv, subfv_*, subgrid) carried byte-identical but not offered as Runner engine choices, and Boann's own command line (boann.py, cli.py) and version (version.py, BOANN_VERSION). From DamIT Runner 0.9.0 (before: DWR main 3f536222 without the sub-grid FV files). No prebuilt/ CPU libraries are shipped (DamSafety's release workflow builds them); the CPU build is compiled once on first use. PARITY.json is synced to a commit without this folder, so scripts/check_engine_parity.py skips these files; tests/test_gpu_engine.py checks the sha256 below.",
